{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2021-11-24 06:50:00', 'title': 'BD NAMES FRANCESCA DEMARTINO AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS', 'text': 'FRANKLIN LAKES, N.J., NOV. 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BD (BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY) (NYSE: BDX), A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED FRANCESCA DEMARTINO HAS BEEN NAMED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS FOR THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE NOV. 29.'}